# accounts.txt.example — Template for KinanCity Account Queue
# Copy this file to accounts.txt and add your credentials:
#   cp accounts.txt.example accounts.txt
#
# FORMAT: username:password   (one per line)
#
# Rules:
#   - Username: 6–16 alphanumeric characters (PTC requirement)
#   - Password: 8+ characters with uppercase, lowercase, number, and symbol
#   - Lines starting with # are comments and are skipped
#   - Blank lines are skipped
#
# Examples (replace with real accounts in accounts.txt):
# TrainerJason01:YourP@ssw0rd1
# TrainerJason02:YourP@ssw0rd2
